    "norm": "Tests {@link CharRange#equals(Object)}. <p>Two {@link CharRange} instances are equal only when they describe the same start, end and negation. This test verifies the contract from three angles: a range is never equal to {@code null}, a range is equal to itself and to any other range built the same way, and ranges that cover different characters are not equal.</p>"
